# fill-anywhere (contract-fill-anywhere.md D3-D8 b): 34 steps, 4 click lines. A flat copy of hello.pdf in Fill forms: a click on empty space opens a text-box editor, Enter adds a FreeText sized to its text; a click re-edits it, a drag and an arrow move it; Save on the filled document is cancelled without a path and with a path writes "flat (filled).pdf" and rebinds; a second box saves in place; Delete removes it and undo brings it back; a rotated page refuses; review: an empty fill-text and a read-only document refuse in error, and an edit that only adds a trailing blank line writes nothing. Pinned in tests/fill-anywhere.test.mjs.
